  "body_html": "<p>I like to have some positivity here on Substack…so I will throw in a very bullish stock at the end of this article 😊</p><p>It’s so silly, the games we have to play to be successful on social media. I wish I could just make a video, saying where I think the markets are going to go. But when I do that…guess where that video goes on TikTok….<em><strong>to no one</strong></em>. TikTok, and creators, monetize rage bait and fear baiting. Heck, I even used the audio “Haunting” as background sound. </p><p>If you are going to follow me, follow 100%, or not at all. Watching 5 or 10 seconds of a video will leave you uninformed and angry later on. Realize that as a finance creator, <strong>I have to play the social media game.</strong> I literally say the market is bullish in this video…and it took just minutes for the first attention deficit disorder plagued individual to leave a nasty comment. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg\" width=\"1206\" height=\"433\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:433,&quot;width&quot;:1206,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:null,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:null,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!A92V!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa982f96c-13db-453f-b684-fa98e8c6e7cd_1206x433.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Someone watched 5 seconds of the video. Per usual on TikTok. I’ve never said anything about climate change, I know nothing about that. </figcaption></figure></div><p>To be clear, I do think we will have a -80% crash, or at least a drastic market fall off. In this video, I give a best, speculative estimate, of <strong>when. </strong>That is the inevitable fate of a meltup and blow off top… a melt down. But we are still in the blow off top phase. I consistently see people shorting the market… only to get absolutely bamboozled. <strong>We are currently in a bull market, and I expect it to continue! </strong></p><p>If you are ever confused by one of my posts or forecasts, you can always <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/d7312c75-2778-49bd-9b8e-ccab72528629\">Tag Me In The Main Main Chat</a> </strong>during market hours, and I’ll be happy to clarify!</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><strong>If you are unaware of what a “boom and bust cycle” is, it largely comprises of 3 parts:</strong></p><ol><li><p><strong>Melt-up (1-3 years)</strong></p><ol><li><p>A rapid, unexpected surge in asset prices driven heavily by investor frenzy, in poor economic conditions. Think of things like Nvidia, Palantir, GE Vernova, Meta, and many others the last few years, that went to the moon, all while layoffs were in abundance, affordability was decreasing and the overall economy is just pure bad for average people. </p></li></ol></li><li><p><strong>Blow-Off Top (1-2 years)</strong></p><ol><li><p>A euphoric peak of a melt-up. Asset prices literally skyrocket, with extreme volatility. Economic conditions remain poor. I believe we are 1 year into this blow-off top and remain in those conditions. </p></li></ol></li><li><p><strong>Meltdown (1+ years)</strong></p><ol><li><p>A swift and brutal collapse once the bubble pops. Speculative gains are wiped out. Normally a catalyst will need to trigger this event. Could be anything: war, famine, disease, etc. No, I have no idea what the catalyst will be, but there are plenty of black swans circling above. </p></li></ol></li></ol><p>Will it be a strait line upward? Unlikely. In fact, its been pretty painful chop upwards, another common element of a blow off top. </p><h4>PRICE ACTION IS KING!!!</h4><h4>The market is trending upwards, we have tons of great macro setups, our positions are moving upwards… All is good! For now. Please ignore my rage bait video title and scary music! This is just a speculative estimate.</h4><p>As I have for several years, I will keep you updated on where I think we are at. But again: watch all of the content…or none at all! I also have this article posted: <em><strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/brief-stock-market-update-when-to?r=4z8lgl\">When To Sell</a>, </strong></em>if you want some clues as to what signals I am looking for to cash out. </p><p>Ok, now that we got some of the real talk done, and past the rage bait + scary music…this stock is looking incredibly bullish: </p>",
